WEBVTT

01:40.740 --> 01:45.750
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.280 --> 01:50.660
[Episode 34]

02:06.840 --> 02:08.360
Huaizhu, look.

02:09.000 --> 02:11.130
This is Puppy Li's farewell gift to me.

02:11.710 --> 02:13.040
No matter where you are,

02:13.120 --> 02:13.910
with this talisman,

02:13.910 --> 02:16.970
you can be sent
more than three miles away in an instant!

02:22.750 --> 02:23.630
Huaizhu.

02:30.570 --> 02:31.560
Huaizhu.

02:33.400 --> 02:35.400
I was just dreaming, wasn't I?

02:37.630 --> 02:39.630
Father isn't dead, right?

02:41.360 --> 02:42.240
Qinlan.

02:43.870 --> 02:45.150
Listen to me.

02:47.030 --> 02:48.360
Father is gone.

02:49.800 --> 02:51.120
You have to leave.

02:54.710 --> 02:55.640
I'm not leaving!

02:56.680 --> 02:58.010
I'm going to avenge him!

02:59.750 --> 03:00.630
If you stay,

03:01.430 --> 03:03.120
we're just waiting to die.

03:04.800 --> 03:05.960
You must go.

03:06.710 --> 03:08.040
Then let's go together.

03:16.370 --> 03:18.070
I found these

03:18.280 --> 03:21.030
in your room a while ago.

03:23.990 --> 03:25.450
I'm returning them to you.

03:27.430 --> 03:28.400
Sorry, Qinlan.

03:30.120 --> 03:31.120
I was too strict

03:32.410 --> 03:33.630
with you before.

03:36.150 --> 03:36.960
From now on,

03:38.090 --> 03:40.620
only remember
the good things about me, okay?

03:45.030 --> 03:46.240
These two candies—

03:46.520 --> 03:48.430
one was meant for you.

03:49.960 --> 03:52.420
You said
the candied hawthorn was too sweet.

03:52.520 --> 03:55.030
So I thought the sour and sweet hawthorn

03:55.310 --> 03:57.030
might be to your liking.

04:08.360 --> 04:11.090
They say
people who like sweets have soft hearts.

04:11.800 --> 04:13.080
Qinlan,

04:13.590 --> 04:16.560
you'll stay this wild, fiery,

04:16.800 --> 04:17.950
and carefree, okay?

04:19.560 --> 04:20.269
Huaizhu,

04:21.600 --> 04:23.800
I could never leave you behind.

04:26.070 --> 04:27.270
After you go out,

04:28.950 --> 04:30.150
you can call for help.

04:32.070 --> 04:34.190
Yes, I can go find Hongye.

04:37.159 --> 04:39.020
Hongye went beyond the Boundary.

04:39.360 --> 04:41.220
We don't know if he's still alive.

04:44.390 --> 04:46.050
Then I can go to Ruyi Pavilion.

04:46.070 --> 04:47.560
It has many branches.

04:50.290 --> 04:52.420
My Qinlan is so clever.

04:54.510 --> 04:55.630
But remember,

04:57.280 --> 04:58.430
your safety

04:59.310 --> 05:01.710
matters more than delivering the message.

05:01.830 --> 05:03.360
Your happiness

05:04.430 --> 05:07.310
is more important than revenge.

05:24.390 --> 05:25.560
Don't come back.

05:27.110 --> 05:29.170
The bloodline of the Dongfang family

05:29.860 --> 05:31.490
must live on.

05:59.159 --> 06:01.620
You said
the candied hawthorn was too sweet.

06:01.720 --> 06:04.040
So I thought the sour and sweet hawthorn

06:04.510 --> 06:06.360
might be to your liking.

06:15.830 --> 06:16.750
Qinlan,

06:17.830 --> 06:20.070
I really like the hawthorn candy.

06:22.430 --> 06:24.040
You must stay safe.

06:27.360 --> 06:28.360
Don't worry.

06:29.750 --> 06:30.800
Father's death—

06:32.070 --> 06:33.120
I will avenge it.

06:46.190 --> 06:49.040
Physician, how is Young Master Wangquan?

06:49.870 --> 06:52.720
His spiritual energy is nearly depleted.

06:52.870 --> 06:55.400
With such severe physical and mental trauma,

06:55.510 --> 06:57.240
he has no will to live.

06:58.390 --> 06:59.680
I'm afraid...

07:34.409 --> 07:37.080
Wangquan Hongye, do you see it?

07:39.640 --> 07:43.380
All this tragedy—you caused it.

07:45.510 --> 07:48.159
You led them all to their deaths.

07:48.190 --> 07:50.970
They died unjustly because of you.

07:51.470 --> 07:53.200
They could never rest in peace.

08:06.910 --> 08:09.210
[The Li family of Peach Garden]

08:36.200 --> 08:37.169
Quzhuo.

08:37.409 --> 08:39.409
I've saved up over 1,000 talismans.

08:39.970 --> 08:41.549
They're all under your bed.

08:44.030 --> 08:45.670
Are you entrusting your legacy to me?

08:45.670 --> 08:48.030
Are you entrusting your talismans to me

08:48.030 --> 08:50.300
or entrusting me to your talismans?

08:50.460 --> 08:52.110
That's nonsense!

08:52.440 --> 08:54.040
If you dare to die before I do,

08:54.050 --> 08:56.510
I'll burn every last one of those talismans.

08:57.950 --> 09:00.080
You're really acting like a puppy now.

09:11.720 --> 09:12.550
Quzhuo.

09:14.200 --> 09:14.960
Zhuo.

09:15.750 --> 09:16.630
Be good.

09:17.320 --> 09:18.760
Remove this talisman.

09:20.600 --> 09:22.440
Let Mom go in and see you.

09:23.160 --> 09:24.970
Just one look, please?

09:26.320 --> 09:27.420
I…

09:27.460 --> 09:29.900
I've lost your elder brother.

09:29.920 --> 09:31.670
I can't lose you too.

09:31.750 --> 09:33.550
It's all Wangquan Hongye's fault!

09:33.550 --> 09:34.880
He ruined everything.

09:35.070 --> 09:38.470
He's the reason
one of my sons is dead and the other is injured.

09:39.000 --> 09:40.500
I swear…

09:40.850 --> 09:43.130
I swear I'll make him pay.

09:44.440 --> 09:46.600
Don't blame Hongye.

09:49.080 --> 09:50.320
It's not his fault.

09:51.150 --> 09:52.180
Zhuo,

09:52.360 --> 09:53.360
alright, alright.

09:53.360 --> 09:55.610
We'll listen to you—whatever you say.

09:55.920 --> 10:00.270
As long as you let us come in to see you.

10:00.750 --> 10:03.000
Zhuo, listen to your mom.

10:03.030 --> 10:04.360
Open the door.

10:04.600 --> 10:05.550
Let us in.

10:05.550 --> 10:07.370
Yes, Zhuo.

10:07.630 --> 10:08.550
Please…

10:10.790 --> 10:12.520
Just leave me alone for a while.

10:14.030 --> 10:14.870
Let's go.

10:47.500 --> 10:48.630
This is for you.

10:49.790 --> 10:52.080
When you meet a girl
you really like someday,

10:52.080 --> 10:53.680
give this to her.

12:08.750 --> 12:10.270
I'm Li Quzhuo, the second son

12:10.270 --> 12:12.070
of the Li family of Peach Garden!

12:13.320 --> 12:14.490
Quzhuo.

12:14.750 --> 12:16.410
Stop messing around, Quzhuo.

12:22.190 --> 12:23.030
Guess what?

12:23.030 --> 12:23.320
What?

12:23.320 --> 12:23.840
What?

12:24.360 --> 12:27.520
He ran off with her
as if he was under some love spell.

12:28.220 --> 12:29.990
Really?

12:29.750 --> 12:33.740
♪ A sudden storm fills the night ♪

12:34.370 --> 12:38.360
♪ 3,000 mayflies plunge into the dark river ♪

12:36.120 --> 12:38.760
Welcome, Mr. and Mrs. Wangquan.

12:38.760 --> 12:40.130
♪ The relentless march of time ♪

12:40.750 --> 12:42.940
♪ Sweeping away the young you and me ♪

12:43.390 --> 12:44.920
♪ I open my eyes ♪

12:45.600 --> 12:47.920
♪ To the color of the night ♪

12:48.830 --> 12:52.860
♪ With a wave of the sword, the mountains and rivers are ravaged ♪

12:53.300 --> 12:57.430
♪ In an instant, I shelter myself in this fleeting life ♪

12:54.270 --> 12:56.510
Come on. Let's get drunk tonight.

12:56.530 --> 12:58.180
Let's drink to our hearts' content.

12:58.040 --> 13:00.230
♪ Countless times we traversed cliffs and abysses ♪

12:58.210 --> 12:58.670
Sure.

12:58.720 --> 12:59.270
Sure!

12:59.270 --> 12:59.440
Cheers.

12:59.440 --> 12:59.900
Cheers.

12:59.960 --> 13:00.120
Cheers.

13:00.120 --> 13:01.240
Cheers!

13:01.130 --> 13:02.690
♪ Side by side ♪

13:02.720 --> 13:03.850
Hongye, Huaizhu,

13:03.040 --> 13:07.190
♪ I remember every moment as clearly as daylight ♪

13:03.960 --> 13:05.360
at your wedding banquet…

13:06.860 --> 13:08.530
I must sit at the main table.

13:08.190 --> 13:10.070
♪ This heavy snowfall brought by fate ♪

13:10.390 --> 13:11.600
We're all older than you.

13:10.400 --> 13:11.350
♪ This hopeless struggle ♪

13:11.600 --> 13:12.790
You don't get to sit at the main table.

13:11.740 --> 13:12.840
♪ Is it insoluble? ♪

13:12.960 --> 13:14.830
Can you even hold your liquor?

13:13.000 --> 13:13.720
♪ Your warmth ♪

13:13.970 --> 13:17.000
♪ A trace alone breaks down my heart's defenses ♪

13:17.660 --> 13:19.730
♪ Across countless withered bones and fallen leaves ♪

13:20.300 --> 13:22.170
♪ Watching a blood-red sunset together ♪

13:20.630 --> 13:23.790
Puppy Li! Puppy Li! Puppy Li!

13:22.720 --> 13:23.990
♪ I thank the heavens ♪

13:23.790 --> 13:25.970
Lightweight! Lightweight!

13:24.660 --> 13:26.640
♪ I get to brave the blizzard with you in this life ♪

13:26.150 --> 13:27.720
You wanna go outside and fight with me?

13:27.130 --> 13:29.210
♪ With the wind ♪

13:27.720 --> 13:28.820
Forget it.

13:29.750 --> 13:31.490
♪ Comes countless farewells ♪

13:31.840 --> 13:33.880
♪ Whose lashes ♪

13:34.570 --> 13:36.300
♪ Are dyed red? ♪

13:37.080 --> 13:38.790
♪ Even if a single sword ♪

13:39.640 --> 13:41.120
♪ Turns love and hate to ashes ♪

13:41.470 --> 13:42.290
♪ You still come to me ♪

13:42.700 --> 13:45.640
♪ Fulfilling our destiny ♪

14:05.420 --> 14:09.450
♪ With a wave of the sword, the mountains and rivers are ravaged ♪

14:07.420 --> 14:08.230
Hongye,

14:09.200 --> 14:10.320
20 years later,

14:09.890 --> 14:14.020
♪ In an instant, I shelter myself in this fleeting life ♪

14:10.440 --> 14:11.960
will the whole Mask Group

14:12.630 --> 14:14.680
really be wiped out?

14:14.630 --> 14:16.820
♪ Countless times we traversed cliffs and abysses ♪

14:17.720 --> 14:19.280
♪ Side by side ♪

14:19.930 --> 14:23.260
♪ I remember every moment as clearly as daylight ♪

14:24.780 --> 14:26.660
♪ This heavy snowfall brought by fate ♪

14:26.990 --> 14:28.040
♪ This hopeless struggle ♪

14:28.520 --> 14:29.430
♪ Is it insoluble? ♪

14:29.590 --> 14:30.310
♪ Your warmth ♪

14:30.560 --> 14:33.590
♪ A trace alone breaks down my heart's defenses ♪

14:33.730 --> 14:35.100
In this life,

14:34.250 --> 14:36.320
♪ Across countless withered bones and fallen leaves ♪

14:35.120 --> 14:36.450
I've found a true friend

14:36.820 --> 14:38.600
to celebrate my happy moments

14:36.890 --> 14:38.760
♪ Watching a blood-red sunset together ♪

14:38.990 --> 14:40.620
and brave hardships together.

14:39.310 --> 14:40.580
♪ I thank the heavens ♪

14:41.250 --> 14:43.230
♪ I get to brave the blizzard with you in this life ♪

14:41.700 --> 14:42.890
I'm beyond lucky.

14:59.650 --> 15:00.320
Hongye.

15:22.040 --> 15:23.810
♪ With the wind ♪

15:24.630 --> 15:26.080
♪ Comes countless farewells ♪

15:26.750 --> 15:28.620
♪ Whose lashes ♪

15:29.480 --> 15:30.900
♪ Are dyed red? ♪

15:31.820 --> 15:33.500
♪ Even if a single sword ♪

15:34.440 --> 15:35.700
♪ Turns love and hate to ashes ♪

15:36.090 --> 15:36.980
♪ You still come to me ♪

15:37.200 --> 15:40.000
Can the future really be changed?

15:37.460 --> 15:40.370
♪ Fulfilling our destiny ♪

15:40.000 --> 15:40.860
Yes, of course!

15:41.000 --> 15:42.970
Didn't we create the Mask Group

15:41.260 --> 15:42.960
♪ The rain falls ♪

15:43.080 --> 15:44.950
to break all the rules

15:43.910 --> 15:45.170
♪ Tearing apart the long night ♪

15:45.080 --> 15:46.560
and challenge the impossible?

15:45.910 --> 15:47.420
♪ Unraveling ♪

15:46.790 --> 15:48.100
Keeping peace between humans and demons,

15:48.100 --> 15:50.080
breaking the darkness,
and destroying the Black Fox—

15:48.840 --> 15:50.120
♪ My suppressed tribulation ♪

15:50.270 --> 15:51.700
even if the goal feels out of reach,

15:50.690 --> 15:52.590
♪ Flowers on the distant end bloom ♪

15:53.260 --> 15:54.330
as long as Yuan is here,

15:53.450 --> 15:54.910
♪ So near yet so far ♪

15:55.110 --> 15:55.990
I believe we can make it.

15:55.610 --> 15:59.120
♪ Get dead drunk again, with no care for the passing of time ♪

16:00.140 --> 16:01.820
♪ The rain falls ♪

16:02.710 --> 16:04.180
♪ Tearing apart the long night ♪

16:04.790 --> 16:06.560
♪ Unraveling ♪

16:07.550 --> 16:08.990
♪ My suppressed tribulation ♪

16:09.450 --> 16:10.000
Hongye.

16:09.680 --> 16:11.610
♪ Flowers on the distant end bloom ♪

16:11.510 --> 16:12.270
Thank you.

16:12.380 --> 16:13.760
♪ So near yet so far ♪

16:14.500 --> 16:16.050
You must be happy too.

16:14.590 --> 16:19.280
♪ Get dead drunk again, with no care for the passing of time ♪

17:23.160 --> 17:24.920
The Black Fox is terrifyingly powerful.

17:24.920 --> 17:26.349
She can control people.

17:27.010 --> 17:27.750
But Father...

17:27.750 --> 17:28.790
No buts!

17:28.920 --> 17:31.000
Unless you're sure you can kill her,

17:32.110 --> 17:34.330
you must not risk your life recklessly.

17:37.060 --> 17:39.070
You must not let my efforts go to waste,

17:39.070 --> 17:41.310
nor the efforts of everyone else!

17:51.070 --> 17:52.270
Young man,

17:52.680 --> 17:55.180
what awaits after confronting the darkness

17:55.650 --> 17:58.340
is something you can't bear!

18:07.570 --> 18:09.300
Wangquan Hongye.

18:09.590 --> 18:12.210
I can see the fear in your heart.

18:24.820 --> 18:27.260
You're destined to lose your loved ones.

18:27.290 --> 18:30.370
All struggles are futile.

18:30.510 --> 18:33.750
Fate cannot be rewritten.

18:38.000 --> 18:42.630
The human heart is a swamp.
Where can purity remain?

18:56.030 --> 18:57.160
Are you in despair?

19:36.200 --> 19:38.210
They're all dead.

19:38.310 --> 19:40.440
You failed to protect them.

20:36.420 --> 20:39.990
[Lanzhu Garden]

20:48.070 --> 20:48.880
Miss Huaizhu.

20:50.090 --> 20:51.510
You've locked yourself in your room,

20:51.510 --> 20:53.010
refusing to come out.

20:53.200 --> 20:55.130
Why are you doing this to yourself?

20:55.420 --> 20:57.400
Senior Renfeng has prepared

20:57.400 --> 20:58.750
your wedding dress.

20:59.080 --> 21:01.830
It's a special order from Tiansang Pavilion—

21:01.830 --> 21:03.000
a jeweled gown and hairpins

21:03.000 --> 21:04.240
inlaid with kingfisher feathers,

21:04.240 --> 21:06.400
woven with golden silkworm thread.

21:07.510 --> 21:09.640
It's quite expensive,

21:10.550 --> 21:13.810
fit for a young lady of your status.

21:14.440 --> 21:16.880
I see. Just leave it at the door.

21:18.930 --> 21:19.970
Miss Huaizhu,

21:20.790 --> 21:21.880
maybe something's wrong with my ears,

21:21.880 --> 21:22.880
but why haven't I

21:22.880 --> 21:24.540
heard a word from Miss Qinlan?

21:26.610 --> 21:28.660
Qinlan fell ill a few days ago.

21:29.720 --> 21:31.320
Yuping is taking care of her.

21:34.320 --> 21:36.480
You're so sensible, Miss Huaizhu.

21:37.030 --> 21:41.170
You know when to yield to circumstances.

21:42.270 --> 21:44.130
I'll leave the dress at your door.

21:45.160 --> 21:46.880
Please come out and get it.

21:49.400 --> 21:50.590
At a time like this,

21:50.680 --> 21:52.200
why still put on airs?

21:52.790 --> 21:53.750
How dare you speak to

21:53.130 --> 21:56.750
[Lanzhu Garden]

21:53.750 --> 21:55.920
Miss Huaizhu
of the Divine Fire Villa like that?

21:55.920 --> 21:56.850
Senior Renfeng.

22:02.240 --> 22:03.170
Junior Huaizhu,

22:03.680 --> 22:05.200
I truly care for you.

22:06.200 --> 22:08.060
I don't want to push you like this.

22:08.810 --> 22:10.120
I know deep down,

22:11.200 --> 22:14.400
you're still hoping
Wangquan Hongye will come flying in.

22:15.610 --> 22:17.470
The Yiqi Alliance just sent word—

22:18.110 --> 22:20.040
all eight members of the Mask Group

22:20.440 --> 22:22.240
died beyond the Boundary.

22:22.750 --> 22:23.720
None survived.

22:26.000 --> 22:29.440
Junior Huaizhu,
Wangquan Hongye won't be coming.

22:30.960 --> 22:32.760
If you keep being this stubborn,

22:33.190 --> 22:36.670
what good will it do for you or Qinlan?

22:40.790 --> 22:41.550
Dong.

22:41.550 --> 22:42.240
Yes.

22:42.350 --> 22:44.030
All Miss Huaizhu's requests

22:44.600 --> 22:45.660
must be fulfilled.

22:45.960 --> 22:46.720
Yes.

22:51.810 --> 22:56.630
[Lanzhu Garden]

23:14.400 --> 23:15.630
Hongye...

23:19.040 --> 23:20.950
you really didn't make it back?

23:44.270 --> 23:45.680
Huaizhu, wait for me.

23:46.240 --> 23:47.400
I'll get help

23:47.510 --> 23:48.880
and go back to save you.

23:52.960 --> 23:54.020
Search carefully!

23:54.110 --> 23:54.680
Yes.

23:57.500 --> 23:58.310
Make way!

23:59.070 --> 24:00.160
Who are they looking for?

24:00.160 --> 24:00.720
Hurry up!

24:00.880 --> 24:01.870
Quick, quick!

24:02.000 --> 24:04.330
Search thoroughly. Don't let her escape!

24:07.800 --> 24:08.520
Move aside!

24:15.200 --> 24:16.160
Miss Qinlan.

24:16.660 --> 24:20.280
Master Jin already guessed
you'd go to Ruyi Pavilion.

24:20.520 --> 24:22.360
We've had everything set up.

24:23.110 --> 24:26.120
Just come back with us.

24:29.310 --> 24:30.910
You've got the wrong person.

24:31.930 --> 24:33.440
Miss Qinlan,

24:34.030 --> 24:37.500
just be good and come back with us.

24:42.640 --> 24:44.680
Over here! Qinlan is here!

24:44.700 --> 24:45.860
After her!

24:48.070 --> 24:49.440
Out of the way!

24:49.490 --> 24:49.920
Hurry!

24:50.100 --> 24:51.570
-Move! Move!
-Move!

24:51.960 --> 24:52.750
Move aside!

24:53.920 --> 24:54.850
Out of the way!

24:55.550 --> 24:56.160
Move!

24:59.550 --> 25:01.590
Sir, would you like to buy a sachet?

25:01.590 --> 25:03.160
It brings safety and good luck.

25:03.160 --> 25:06.360
It can also be given
as a token of love to someone you fancy.

25:07.030 --> 25:08.360
I'd like to see that one.

25:09.550 --> 25:10.070
Here.

25:12.730 --> 25:13.810
This is for you.

25:17.040 --> 25:19.280
When you meet a girl
you really like someday,

25:19.280 --> 25:21.060
give this to her.

25:25.350 --> 25:26.000
Puppy Li.

25:26.400 --> 25:27.030
Take care.

25:30.160 --> 25:31.290
Have a safe journey.

25:37.110 --> 25:37.830
Qinlan,

25:38.890 --> 25:40.350
I wish

25:40.680 --> 25:42.680
you could find your true love soon

25:43.590 --> 25:46.720
and live a carefree and safe life forever.

25:49.240 --> 25:50.040
Out of the way!

25:55.240 --> 25:56.400
Not her. Let's go.

25:58.030 --> 25:58.750
Move!

25:59.460 --> 26:00.620
Where did she go?

26:46.510 --> 26:47.240
Sir.

26:48.230 --> 26:49.630
Would you like to buy one?

26:52.470 --> 26:53.210
No.

26:56.350 --> 26:57.070
Let's go.

27:07.950 --> 27:09.510
Hurry, over there.

27:13.610 --> 27:14.810
Don't let her escape.

27:16.170 --> 27:16.910
Over there.

27:18.260 --> 27:18.960
Hurry!

27:32.410 --> 27:33.840
Miss Qinlan,

27:34.030 --> 27:35.600
how did you manage to escape?

27:35.600 --> 27:37.400
It seems Master Jin isn't aware.

27:37.860 --> 27:40.440
But fortunately,
Master Jin had prepared for this

27:40.440 --> 27:41.700
and kept a backup plan.

27:42.400 --> 27:43.000
Pah!

27:44.540 --> 27:46.360
Who are you calling Master?

27:46.510 --> 27:48.110
That scoundrel Jin Renfeng?

27:48.310 --> 27:49.240
He's not worthy!

27:49.770 --> 27:50.770
Miss Qinlan,

27:51.310 --> 27:52.770
stop wasting your breath.

27:53.270 --> 27:55.400
You'd better come with us obediently.

28:29.540 --> 28:30.400
Boss,

28:30.580 --> 28:32.380
we forced Miss Qinlan to her death.

28:32.380 --> 28:34.780
Miss Huaizhu definitely won't let this go.

28:34.880 --> 28:35.710
When they find out,

28:35.710 --> 28:37.800
Jin Renfeng will blame us for everything

28:37.800 --> 28:39.430
to win her favor.

28:43.940 --> 28:46.980
You all know how ruthless Jin Renfeng is.

28:47.590 --> 28:48.850
If you want to survive,

28:48.960 --> 28:50.020
do exactly as I say.

28:50.640 --> 28:51.380
Today,

28:52.800 --> 28:54.590
we didn't see Miss Qinlan.

28:55.720 --> 28:56.250
Let's go.

29:34.070 --> 29:35.590
It's finally the end.

29:37.620 --> 29:38.480
Qinlan.

29:39.880 --> 29:40.810
Are you alright?

29:43.240 --> 29:44.000
And...

29:45.830 --> 29:46.310
you.

29:49.360 --> 29:55.230
[On July 7th, Bamboo Pavilion by River Huai]

29:54.610 --> 29:55.410
Young Master,

29:56.250 --> 29:59.090
the Wangquan Manor
can't go a single day without a leader.

29:59.090 --> 30:00.820
Since you've returned safely,

30:01.940 --> 30:05.330
I think it's time to arrange a ceremony

30:05.650 --> 30:08.570
to announce you as the family master.

30:12.030 --> 30:12.830
Young Master,

30:13.770 --> 30:16.530
even if you don't care about yourself,

30:16.790 --> 30:20.380
won't you at least consider Miss Huaizhu?

30:22.030 --> 30:24.110
The moment you returned injured,

30:24.400 --> 30:25.930
I immediately sent someone

30:26.070 --> 30:28.640
to deliver word to the Divine Fire Villa.

30:30.200 --> 30:31.640
But the messenger

30:32.350 --> 30:34.270
didn't see Miss Huaizhu.

30:45.300 --> 30:46.590
Catch Dongfang Huaizhu!

30:46.590 --> 30:47.510
Don't let her escape!

30:47.510 --> 30:48.640
Go! Go!

31:10.400 --> 31:11.900
Junior Huaizhu,

31:11.960 --> 31:14.110
why do you have to be so stubborn?

31:13.500 --> 31:14.540
[Serenity and Purpose]

31:14.860 --> 31:18.060
The Divine Fire Villa
has long submitted to my authority.

31:19.660 --> 31:22.440
What can you alone possibly change?

31:23.880 --> 31:25.970
The wise know when to go with the flow.

31:26.750 --> 31:29.720
Junior Huaizhu, be good and surrender.

31:30.030 --> 31:31.890
You killed your master for power.

31:33.200 --> 31:34.860
Ungrateful and treacherous.

31:36.270 --> 31:38.000
You despicable wretch!

31:38.960 --> 31:40.690
Winners rule, and losers fall.

31:41.510 --> 31:43.240
What's despicable about that?

31:43.440 --> 31:45.370
You've really made me speechless.

31:45.650 --> 31:46.510
While I was distracted,

31:46.510 --> 31:48.440
you secretly sent Qinlan out.

31:49.540 --> 31:50.790
But that's fine.

31:51.160 --> 31:53.310
I'm not in a rush to find her.

31:53.440 --> 31:55.320
Because what I care about more

31:55.680 --> 31:56.590
is you.

31:57.200 --> 31:58.550
Shameless!

32:16.230 --> 32:17.880
Junior Huaizhu,

32:18.110 --> 32:19.970
you're at your limit, aren't you?

32:20.720 --> 32:22.070
We're fellow disciples,

32:22.070 --> 32:23.860
so I've gone easy on you.

32:23.920 --> 32:25.740
I didn't even use the strong poison.

32:25.740 --> 32:27.960
But soon, you'll lose too much blood,

32:28.330 --> 32:29.830
your mind will start to blur,

32:29.830 --> 32:32.160
and your limbs will stop listening to you.

32:32.430 --> 32:33.670
Before long,

32:33.690 --> 32:36.370
my lifelong wish will come true.

32:38.180 --> 32:39.750
From now on,

32:40.720 --> 32:42.030
you'll be mine.

32:58.680 --> 33:03.110
My mind is starting to blur.

33:05.200 --> 33:06.070
I can't

33:06.530 --> 33:07.870
lift my hands anymore.

33:10.910 --> 33:12.880
I really miss River Huai

33:14.720 --> 33:16.050
and that bamboo forest.

33:22.770 --> 33:24.570
I truly wish

33:25.160 --> 33:26.200
to see you again,

33:28.160 --> 33:29.790
to see you above the clouds

33:30.260 --> 33:31.330
and come back to me.

33:36.460 --> 33:37.690
When you come back,

33:38.270 --> 33:41.110
we still have so many things to do together.

33:41.590 --> 33:42.920
Wait for me to come back.

34:11.630 --> 34:12.770
What's going on?

34:12.920 --> 34:14.719
The gates have been struck open!

34:15.320 --> 34:16.510
That sword energy...
